<title>POLAND: Polish stocks close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish stocks close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven stocks rose, six fell and four were flat in 5.7-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Friday, with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,612.1 points, 0.2 percent higher than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining six stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 0.7 percent to 148 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
